{"data": {"Page": {"pageInfo": {"currentPage": 8, "hasNextPage": true}, "media": [{"id": 102425, "title": {"romaji": "Yeonae Haru Jeon", "english": "A Day Before Us"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "During a rain shower, college student Ha Eun encounters a young man named Yeon Woo who has an umbrella. As the tent above them is about to burst apart from the heavy rain, she latches onto Yeon Woo in order to shield herself. Not realizing that what she had just done was embarrassing she tries to ignore Yeon Woo the rest of the time. Little does she know, he's the friend of her best friend, Yeo Reum who is a bright faced and childish young woman. Annoyed by the fact that she keeps coming across the neutral faced and quiet Yeon Woo she tries her best to stand up for herself in front of the quiet man.<br>\n<br>\nMeanwhile, a shy man named Wook is also good friends with Yeo Reum and also has a secret crush on her and keeps on staring at her sweet lips. But, being shy and awkward around her, he does his best to hide his secret but, such a thing isn't as easy as it seems. As these two stories clash together, what will happen to them all in the end? Will love flourish and bloom, or, will they just keep on ignoring each others hearts?", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 10, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Romance", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Primarily Adult Cast", "rank": 94, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Heterosexual", "rank": 91, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Iyashikei", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Love Triangle", "rank": 77, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "College", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 45, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 30, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Drawing", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102432, "title": {"romaji": "Shaonian Jinyiwei 2", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The second season of <i>The Young Imperial Guards</i>.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 13, "duration": 20, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure", "Mystery", "Romance"], "tags": [{"name": "Historical", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Martial Arts", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102441, "title": {"romaji": "Oshie to Tabi Suru Otoko", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "The story begins in the early Showa era of the 20th century. A mysterious old man on a train relates the disappearance of his older brother three decades ago, near the 12-story Ryounkaku tower that once stood in the seaside town of Uozu, Japan. The mystery revolves around telescopes, peep shows, and the blurred boundary between reality and dreams.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 1, "duration": 9, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Mystery", "Psychological"], "tags": []}, {"id": 102446, "title": {"romaji": "Sheng Shi Zhuang Niang", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "A beauty blogger has been sent to a VR reality game, where she has to stand firm in a catfight in boudoir. But how so? She is given numerous cosmetic products that she can arm herself up with. Based on the popular online novel published on the famous female-oriented online novel website \"Jinjiang\", this animation is strongly recommended to those who love all kinds of cosmetics.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 11}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 20, "duration": 21, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "WEB_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama", "Fantasy", "Romance"], "tags": [{"name": "Makeup", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Virtual World", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Isekai", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Harem", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Butler", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Heterosexual", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shoujo", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Video Games", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102447, "title": {"romaji": "Mori Shuguang", "english": "Dawn Of The World"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "In the year of 2013, the tide of zombies outbreak exploded in everyone's homeland, humanity launches a large-scale battle in the endless nights awaiting for the arrival of the dawn.\n<br><br>\nThe end is approaching, is there going to be a way out for them? \nTheir faiths were shattered into pieces and buried in ashes in the raging fire. But within the blazing fire, a newborn hope arise once again.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 20, "duration": 17, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "WEB_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Horror", "Psychological", "Supernatural", "Thriller"], "tags": [{"name": "Zombie", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Post-Apocalyptic", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Survival", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Boys' Love", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102458, "title": {"romaji": "Dare no Tame ni Sakura wa Saku", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Official music video for Taku Tomizawa's song Dare no Tame ni Sakura wa Saku which received its EP release back on March 11, 2018. The music video is predominately stop-motion animation of cherry blossom petals which expanded upon the original idea from the EP's trailer which was live-action footage of cherry blossom petals.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 102459, "title": {"romaji": "ROCKET DIVE", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Official music video for Exile Shokichi's song Rocket Dive from their new single titled \"Underdog.\" The music video was included on a DVD during the single's launch and then later featured on Avex Inc.'s official YouTube channel.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 102463, "title": {"romaji": "Dou Po Cangqiong 2", "english": "Fights Break Sphere S2"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The second season of Doupo Cangqiong", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 12, "duration": 20, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "WEB_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy", "Romance"], "tags": [{"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Cultivation", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102510, "title": {"romaji": "Diwang Gonglue", "english": "The Emperor's Strategy"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "As part of the imperial family, every move by Chu Yuan in this game of chess is made with apprehension, fearing that with a moment of inattentiveness, the whole match will be lost in a single move. Ascending to the throne at eighteen, not half a year passes before civil strife erupts in Yun Nan. Though the thoughts of the old guard at the imperial court are not exactly identical, they are all waiting to see how the new emperor will put an end to this.\n<br><br>\n(Source: WeTV)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 20, "duration": 17, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "WEB_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure", "Drama", "Mystery"], "tags": [{"name": "Historical", "rank": 80, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Wuxia", "rank": 77, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 65, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Politics", "rank": 46, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Swordplay", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Boys' Love", "rank": 37, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "War", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102551, "title": {"romaji": "Quote", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Three official music videos for Red, Cambell, and Amador on Suda Keina's \"Quote\" album that was released on January 31, 2018. Avogado6 animated them and they were released on Suda Keina's official YouTube channel as well as airing on Space Shower TV under U&R Records' label.\n<br><br>\nAmador was also used as the theme song for Road to You: Kimi e to Tsuzuku Michi.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 3, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 102559, "title": {"romaji": "Hua Jianghu: Huan Shi Men Sheng", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Nian Yangxiao, came from a parallel world to save his true love who was killed in another dimension. He must find the killer who has a mark on her thigh before it was too late. If his love is killed in this world she will truly be gone forever. He has to deal with the various gangs with the help of a newly acquired power which can stop time.\n<br><br>\n(Source: CrimsonSubs)", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 9}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 20, "duration": 22, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Fantasy", "Mystery", "Romance"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102570, "title": {"romaji": "Xuese Cangqiong", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Li Mingyang was originally an ordinary office worker. Because of a strange QR code, he was trapped in a killing city. Here everyone is forced to participate in a survival game that is going to kill or be killed. In the process of finding a way out of the city, the mastermind behind the whole incident surfaced step by step.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 1}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 26, "duration": 22, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Fantasy", "Horror", "Mystery", "Thriller"], "tags": [{"name": "Survival", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Death Game", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102573, "title": {"romaji": "Utawarerumono: Tusukuru-koujo no Karei Naru Hibi", "english": "Utawarerumono: Imperial Princess Tusukuru's Splendid Days"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "Included with the premium collection release of the PS4 remake of Utawarerumono: Chiriyukumono e no Komoriuta. The anime will tell the story of Kuon's childhood days.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "season": "SPRING", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 1, "duration": 14, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VISUAL_NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Comedy", "Fantasy", "Slice of Life"], "tags": [{"name": "Adoption", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Episodic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102576, "title": {"romaji": "Wangu Xian Qiong 2", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The second season of <i>Wangu Xian Qiong</i>", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 3}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 5}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 12, "duration": 16, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "NOVEL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure", "Comedy", "Fantasy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 102595, "title": {"romaji": "The Starry Night", "english": "The Starry Night"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Official music video for KONCOS' song The Starry Night", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 4, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 102603, "title": {"romaji": "Huyao Xiao Hongniang: Nan Guo", "english": null}, "format": "ONA", "description": "Fifth season of Huyao Xiao Hongniang", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 6}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 26, "duration": 17, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure", "Comedy", "Romance", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Cultivation", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Reincarnation", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Youkai", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Magic", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban Fantasy", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Achronological Order", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Heterosexual", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Matchmaking", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kemonomimi", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Age Regression", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Animals", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Body Swapping", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shapeshifting", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ancient China", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Royal Affairs", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Memory Manipulation", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Brainwashing", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Food", "rank": 40, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102622, "title": {"romaji": "Gundam Build Divers Prologue", "english": "Gundam Build Divers Prologue"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The Gunpla Force Battle Tournament is a big event held in GBN once per year. Competing in the final round are Avalon, led by the champion Kyoya Kujo, and the elite 7th Panzer Division led by the cunning Rommel. Starting with Kyoya's Gundam AGE II Magnum, a variety of Gunpla take to the field to determine which is the strongest force!\n<br><br>\n(Source: Official site)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "season": "WINTER", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 1, "duration": 14, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Mecha", "Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Robots", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Virtual World", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102631, "title": {"romaji": "Yuu☆Yuu☆Hakusho: TWO SHOTS / Noru ka Soru ka", "english": "Yu Yu Hakusho OVA: \"Two Shots\" and \"All or Nothing\""}, "format": "SPECIAL", "description": "Special included in the 25th anniversary Blu-ray box set.\n\nThe special will cover the \"Two Shot\" bonus chapter from the manga's seventh volume, which tells the story of how Kurama and Hiei met, as well as the manga's penultimate chapter \"All or Nothing.\" which shows the main characters reuniting to solve a hostage crisis in the spirit world.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 1, "duration": 29, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Comedy", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Demons", "rank": 96, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shounen", "rank": 90, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban Fantasy", "rank": 85, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Male Cast", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Delinquents", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Super Power", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Martial Arts", "rank": 65, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Terrorism", "rank": 53, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "School", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102650, "title": {"romaji": "Circus", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "A concept movie music video for Super Junior-D&E's single Circus. While the boy band duo is South Korean, the music video was created in Japan for the Japanese release of the single under the Avex Trax record label.\n", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 1, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 102651, "title": {"romaji": "The Perfect World", "english": "The Perfect World"}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Official music video for B: The Beginning's ending theme song The Perfect World. Performed by Marty Friedman feat. Jean-Ken Johnny, KenKen. The music video was released on the music producer Avex's official YouTube channel and it promotes the anime's image album soundtrack going on sale March 7, 2018--only 5 days after the anime is released.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 2}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 83, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Police", "rank": 75, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Amnesia", "rank": 53, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Revenge", "rank": 53, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Fugitive", "rank": 46, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102822, "title": {"romaji": "Senran Kagura SHINOVI MASTER: Tokyo Youma-hen", "english": "SENRAN KAGURA SHINOVI MASTER"}, "format": "TV", "description": "Girls study at schools for modern shinobi. They dedicate their entire young lives to learning to become true shinobi, battling each other to polish their skills. And then one day, Asuka, whose grandfather is a legendary shinobi, encounters an ancient evil being named a \"Youma\" in the back alleys of Tokyo at Christmas time.\n<br><br>\nWhere there is light, there is shadow.  Over 28 of the strongest and most well-endowed ninjas in history, both good and evil, will collide in a battle to determine true justice. And this deadly battle begins... right now.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 12, "duration": 24, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "VIDEO_GAME", "hashtag": "#kaguratv", "genres": ["Action", "Comedy", "Ecchi"], "tags": [{"name": "Ninja", "rank": 88, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 76, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 75, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Henshin", "rank": 70, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Nudity", "rank": 66, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Ensemble Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Adoption", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Monster Girl", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kuudere", "rank": 10, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102832, "title": {"romaji": "Devils’ Line: Anytime Anywhere", "english": "Devils’ Line: Anytime Anywhere"}, "format": "OVA", "description": "Unaired episode bundled with the limited edition of the manga's 12th compiled volume.<br><br>Special episode where Yuuki visits his mother, Midori. She decides to tell him how she met, then fall in love with Tamaki 20 years ago.<br><br>(Source: AniDB)\n\n", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 8}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 1, "duration": 25, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#デビルズライン", "genres": ["Action", "Drama", "Horror", "Romance", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Vampire", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Heterosexual", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102860, "title": {"romaji": "Souten no Ken: REGENESIS 2", "english": "Fist of the Blue Sky: Regenesis 2"}, "format": "ONA", "description": "The second cour of <i>Souten no Ken: REGENESIS</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 12, "duration": 22, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": "#蒼天の拳", "genres": ["Action"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Martial Arts", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Mafia", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Historical", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "War", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 102875, "title": {"romaji": "Himote House", "english": "HIMOTE HOUSE: A share house of super psychic girls"}, "format": "TV_SHORT", "description": "The comedy anime centers on five girls and one cat all living as housemates in Nakano, Tokyo: the three Himote sisters (Tokiyo, Kinami, and Kokoro) whose family manages the \"Himote House,\" Kokoro's classmates Tae and Minamo, and the cat Enishi. The girls live their daily lives trying to figure out ways to be popular, and they (and the cat) all possess a mysterious secret power…<br><br>\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)", "startDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 10}, "endDate": {"year": 2018, "month": 12}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 2018, "episodes": 12, "duration": 12, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": "#ひもてはうす", "genres": ["Comedy"], "tags": [{"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 9